==========================

BestDroid embeds the BeSTspeech / Keynote Gold speech tables (the per-build
data compiled from C:/src/openbst-mirror `src/data/*.c`, i.e. the
`BST_DATA_*` tables behind `bst_lifted_for`) directly inside
`libbestdroid.so`, following the iOS port's *tables-in* configuration
(see C:/src/ibestspeech `iOSProject/build_frameworks.py`: default build
compiles every C source under `src/`, including `src/data`; only public
shipping uses `--no-tables`).

Those tables are third-party voice data: they belong to the original
